Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos15
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos15)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos15)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos15).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos15 adds three modules on frozen lcos14: ax88179_178a
 (CONFIG_USB_NET_AX88179_178A=m, ASIX AX88179/AX88178A, LCOS#100),
 asix (CONFIG_USB_NET_AX8817X=m, AX88172/AX88772), and cdc_ncm
 (CONFIG_USB_NET_CDC_NCM=m, AX88179A/AX88772D on Linux 7.2.6).
 Rust left off (No Forced Rust). No firmware blob is included.
 .
 LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12; that config stays frozen.
 lcos13 and lcos14 stay frozen. This package is the lcos15 revision
 of the same linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke name. On earlier LCOS releases
 that still ship a Distro kernel, installing this metapackage adds a
 GRUB entry alongside it.
